# Images Directory

Place your PNG, JPG, and WebP image files here.

## Recommended Images to Add:

### App Branding
- `logo.png` - Main app logo
- `logo_white.png` - White version of logo
- `splash_background.png` - Splash screen background

### Authentication
- `login_background.png` - Login screen background
- `signup_background.png` - Signup screen background
- `auth_illustration.png` - General auth illustration

### User Interface
- `default_avatar.png` - Default user profile picture
- `profile_placeholder.png` - Profile picture placeholder
- `hero_image.png` - Main hero/banner image

### Onboarding
- `onboarding_1.png` - First onboarding screen
- `onboarding_2.png` - Second onboarding screen  
- `onboarding_3.png` - Third onboarding screen
- `welcome_image.png` - Welcome screen image

### Empty States
- `empty_state.png` - General empty state
- `no_connection.png` - No internet connection
- `error_illustration.png` - Error state illustration

### Features
- `feature_1.png` - Feature illustration 1
- `feature_2.png` - Feature illustration 2
- `feature_3.png` - Feature illustration 3

## File Naming Convention
- Use snake_case (e.g., `login_background.png`)
- Be descriptive but concise
- Include density variants: `logo.png`, `logo@2x.png`, `logo@3x.png`

## Recommended Sizes
- Logo: 512x512px (square)
- Background images: 1080x1920px (9:16 ratio)
- Profile pictures: 256x256px (square)
- Icons within images: 128x128px to 512x512px